ings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/COLABORACIONES_CAUSA.webp","title":"COLABORACIONES CON CAUSA","text":"<p>Apoyamos y difundimos proyectos con causa<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/colaboraciones-con-causa","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn--soft","enable_video":false,"video_link":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_9VUPq3SxOc"}}},"block_order":["template--16770251522260__6393252f-edbf-4a03-b18f-a50b71699109-text_block-1","text_block_m9aqLp","template--16770251522260__6393252f-edbf-4a03-b18f-a50b71699109-text_block-2","28f38a43-db1a-4547-b544-3233c9237d73","616d0cff-4dea-406a-8b1e-f59a360e0485","c60a08e5-e86a-4561-becf-758568ca0a39","faf1c482-9fbf-4af9-9760-5c63e8bb4db4","1099122d-c3e3-47ef-b658-7b8a393e2f90","template--16770251522260__6393252f-edbf-4a03-b18f-a50b71699109-text_block-3","c5bb761e-5243-45a4-8f62-485572a67e75","4c13451d-f503-48bf-900d-e7cf3c6b0642","a6a5150e-9e4f-41e7-b105-387cfe678f7b"],"settings":{"title":"NUESTRAS ÁREAS DE ACCIÓN","bg":"palette--light bg--neutral","align_text":"text-center","scale_image":true,"wh_ratio":1,"grid_large":3,"grid_medium":3,"grid_mobile":1.2,"progress_bar_mobile":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1865125e-af17-4fad-8592-f2e868f12f01":{"type":"section-double","blocks":{"template--16936377450708__1865125e-af17-4fad-8592-f2e868f12f01-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"kicker":"PRODUCCIÓN RESPONSABLE","title":"","text":"<p>El 63<strong>%<\/strong> de nuestra actual colección invierno 26 \"Gran Vía\" fue fabricada con <strong>materiales responsables de bajo impacto ambiental<\/strong>, tales como algodón orgánico, poliéster reciclado, lino y tencel<\/p><p>Nuestras fibras orgánicas están certificadas por el Global Organic Textile Standard; nuestras fibras recicladas están certificadas por el Global Recycled Standard y nuestra viscosa Ecovero cuenta con certificación ecológica de la Unión Europea.<\/p>","font_size":5,"text_columns":1,"align_text":"text-left","button_text":"","button_url":"","button_color":"btn--neutral","button_style":"btn-text-thick-line","text_color":"text--neutral","bg_color":""}},"template--16936377450708__1865125e-af17-4fad-8592-f2e868f12f01-image-1":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/LANDING_I_26-32.png","overlay_opacity":0,"overlay_color":"#000000","enable_overlay_text":false,"kicker":"","title":"","richtext":"","text_align":"align--middle-center","text_color":"text--white","link_text":"VER AHORA","link":"https:\/\/froens.cl\/collections\/sustentables","button_color":"btn--white","button_style":"btn"}}},"block_order":["template--16936377450708__1865125e-af17-4fad-8592-f2e868f12f01-text-1","template--16936377450708__1865125e-af17-4fad-8592-f2e868f12f01-image-1"],"settings":{"height":"use_screen_one_half","brick_gutter":40,"borders":false,"bg_color":"","preload_image":false,"width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a":{"type":"section-icons","blocks":{"template--16936377450708__612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a-icon_block-1":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-basket-return","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/01.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"","text":"<p>En 2018 lanzamos nuestra primera colección de trajes de baño fabricados con material reciclado. Fuimos la primera marca chilena en hacerlos y seguimos hasta el día de hoy.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"template--16936377450708__612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a-icon_block-2":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-shipment-world","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/02.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"","text":"<p>En 2022 nos propusimos disminuir nuestros desechos textiles implementando el plan de circularidad REBORN, basado en 3 pilares: Reparar, Reutilizar y Reciclar, en alianza con Minka, Reparalab y Procitex.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"template--16936377450708__612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a-icon_block-3":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-phone","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/03.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"","text":"<p>Junto a empresas expertas, medimos y mitigamos nuestra huella de carbono, buscando en un futuro, lograr la carbono neutralidad a través de la mejora en nuestros procesos. <\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}},"7d44ff54-bade-44bc-b591-b8bd2217c31d":{"type":"icon_block","settings":{"icon_name":"icon-leaf","icon_alt":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/04.png","icon_color":"#aaaaaa","title":"","text":"<p>A inicios de 2024 lanzamos nuestra plataforma de compra y venta de ropa de segunda mano FROENS SECONDHAND, marcando un hito al ser la primera marca de retail en realizar esta acción concreta con sus propios productos.<\/p>","link_text":"","link_url":""}}},"block_order":["template--16936377450708__612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a-icon_block-1","template--16936377450708__612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a-icon_block-2","template--16936377450708__612336fa-a188-461f-89ab-4515b4a7d24a-icon_block-3","7d44ff54-bade-44bc-b591-b8bd2217c31d"],"settings":{"title":"ALGUNOS HITOS DESTACADOS","bg":"palette--bright bg--bright","icon_alignment":"icon--top","layout":"grid--stacked","align_text":"text-center","width":"wrapper","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"571c6823-0424-43b5-927f-4b44d2f9731a":{"type":"section-logos","blocks":{"template--16936377450708__571c6823-0424-43b5-927f-4b44d2f9731a-logo_image-1":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/LOGO_GREENTICKET.webp","link":"","new_tab":true,"width":140,"spacing":50}},"template--16936377450708__571c6823-0424-43b5-927f-4b44d2f9731a-logo_image-2":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/LOGO_MINKA.webp","link":"","new_tab":true,"width":140,"spacing":50}},"template--16936377450708__571c6823-0424-43b5-927f-4b44d2f9731a-logo_image-3":{"type":"logo_image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/log